\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Posterior estimate of peak age, by metric. We can see that athleticism based metrics (Group 3) seem to peak earlier, when compared to a skill based metric (Group 1). In the plot (R), we see that there is a separation of clusters by "athleticism" (Group 3) and "skill" (Group 1). Group 2 consists of metrics that might require a blend of both abilities.\relax }}{21}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:peaks}{{5}{21}{Posterior estimate of peak age, by metric. We can see that athleticism based metrics (Group 3) seem to peak earlier, when compared to a skill based metric (Group 1). In the plot (R), we see that there is a separation of clusters by "athleticism" (Group 3) and "skill" (Group 1). Group 2 consists of metrics that might require a blend of both abilities.\relax }{figure.caption.8}{}}
